# Paths that `gh-tool.ps1 -All` must never stage.
#
# One pattern per line, `*` and `?` work, `#` starts a comment. Matching is
# case-insensitive so the same list behaves the same on Windows and Linux.
# This list only guards -All; naming a file with -Path always stages it.
#
# data/bundles/_index.json tracks both the CamelCase and the lowercase spelling of
# the Naga and Zeus repos. On a case-insensitive checkout one physical file cannot
# satisfy both keys, so these four always report as modified no matter how many
# times the working tree is reset. They are bot-owned: -All used to sweep them into
# every local commit.
data/bundles/alexnaga_stable.json
data/bundles/immortalzeus_dev.json
data/bundles/immortalzeus_latest.json
data/bundles/immortalzeus_stable.json
